      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively asked the family to read the document text aloud (turn 1), which led the family to reveal they were mixing up the informed consent risk disclosure, the perioperative plan, and the postoperative follow-up. The doctor then explicitly separated these in turn 2, noting that the risk disclosure was a post-op monitoring note, not a current complication. This discovery directly improved the plan's accuracy.",
