          "explanation": "After the family said the drug box was too worn to read and that the pharmacy could not confirm, the doctor integrated this into the plan by sending them to the orthopedic/anesthesia team for direct verification, and also told them not to start or stop the drug until confirmed.",
          "quote": "另一盒旧药外壳磨得厉害，来源也说不清"
